From 6999cec007d4a33980a5b54b77f13d848cc044cf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Eden (Doris) build" <doris@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:39:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 30/40] Eden (Doris): CPU profiler; core layout through Eden's
 own core groups (off by default)

- doris_profiler (off by default): CPU-time timers sample the GPU thread and VulkanWorker about once
  per millisecond of their CPU time (never while they sleep); totals of PC and LR, as module+offset,
  are written to doris_profile.txt in the log folder every 20 seconds
- core layout now uses Eden's CoreGroup system (new Prime and Middle groups), so its periodic
  policy refresh keeps the placement instead of undoing it; default changed to off (Android decides)
